**`transferToUnoccupiedPlot()`** is designed to update the **`plotId`** of an NFT to a free plot within the same landlord. However, it currently does not update the **`plotId`** in the **`ToilerState`** struct for the new plot. As a result, this can lead to different NFTs having the same **`plotId`**.

## Proof of Concept
**`transferToUnoccupiedPlot()`** is implemented as follows:
```Solidity
function transferToUnoccupiedPlot(
        uint256 tokenId,
        uint256 plotId
    ) external override forceFarmPlots(msg.sender) notPaused {
